flowchart TD
    A[Request arrives] --> B{Rate limiter has tokens?}
    B -->|No| R1[Reject: rate limited]
    B -->|Yes| C{Semaphore has capacity within queue-wait timeout?}
    C -->|No| R2[Reject: gateway overloaded]
    C -->|Yes| D[asyncio.timeout deadline starts]
    D --> E[Select provider]
    E --> F[Await provider call]
    F -->|Success| G[Record success, release capacity]
    F -->|ConnectionError or TimeoutError| H{Attempts remaining and provider not pinned?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Jittered exponential backoff, retry]
    I --> E
    H -->|No| J[Record failure, release capacity]
    G --> K[Return response]
    J --> R3[Raise to caller]
